<title>USA: Jordan buys 100,000 T U.S. HRW wheat - exporters.</title>
<headline>Jordan buys 100,000 T U.S. HRW wheat - exporters.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jordan overnight bought a total of 100,000 tonnes U.S. hard red winter wheat slated for last-half August and last-half September delivery, U.S. exporters said.</p>
</text>
